s, or video games!\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should my Aardwolf's name be easy to pronounce?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes! Choose a name that is easy for you and your family to say consistently 🐺. Avoid names that sound too similar to common commands (like \\\"Kit\\\" for \\\"Sit\\\"). A clear, distinct name helps your Aardwolf recognize when you are calling them and strengthens training effectiveness.\"}]]}],\"$L35\",\"$L36\"]}]]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\",\"children\":[\"📖 \",\"Aardwolf\",\" Naming Guide\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",1]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Consider your aardwolf's personality — is it bold, shy, playful, or calm?\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",2]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Look at physical traits like color, size, or unique markings.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",3]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Say the name out loud — does it sound natural and easy to call?\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"cl