els right when you say it aloud. Short, 1-2 syllable names often work best as they are easier for animals to recognize and respond to.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can I use human names for my Aardwolf?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely! Human names are very popular for Aardwolfs 🐺. Names like Oliver, Sophie, Jack, or Emma work wonderfully and add a personal, meaningful touch. Many pet owners prefer human names because they create a stronger emotional connection and feel more like a family member than just a pet.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are some unique Aardwolf names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"For unique Aardwolf names 🐺, consider fantasy-inspired options, names from foreign languages, or creative invented combinations. Our Fantasy Names and Unique Names categories feature one-of-a-kind options drawn from mythology, literature, and pure imagination. You can also draw inspiration from your favorite books, movies, or video games!\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should my Aardwolf's name be easy to pronounce?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes! Choose a name that is easy for you and your family to say consistently 🐺. Avoid names that sound too similar to common commands (like \\\"Kit\\\" for \\\"Sit\\\"). A clear, distinct name helps your Aardwolf recognize when you are calling them and strengthens training effectiveness.\"}]]}],\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\"]}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\",\"children\":[\"📖 \",\"Aardwolf\",\" Naming Guide\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",1]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Consider your aardwolf's personality — is it bold, shy, playful, or calm?\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",2]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Look at physical traits like color, size, or unique markings.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",3]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Say the name out loud — does it sound natural and easy to call?\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",4]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Avoid names that sound like common commands or other pets' names.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",5]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Try out a few nam